// integration-test binary under `tests/`. Each test binary is compiled as its
// own crate and links the whole module, but a given binary only calls the
// subset of URL accessors its scenarios need (e.g. `store_api_test` uses only
// `chasm_url`, while `default_api_client_test` exercises the HTTPS/proxy/CA
